{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>台灣知名主持人小S徐熙娣，自二姊徐熙媛（大S）病逝後停工休息了一段長時間，近來終於復出幕前。她近日來港錄製節目《小姐不熙娣》，不少粉絲在旺角街頭捕捉到其身影。小S被發現漫步旺角女人街掃貨，相當貼地。</p><figure><img alt=\"小S和老公許雅鈞和女兒們（FB@小S 徐熙娣）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260311/1108363267748925440864039.jpeg/pe3VbSNgw0EiFM_p9IReBAQj-PHYQUyhH7V4_R-1eP0\"/><figcaption>小S和老公許雅鈞和女兒們（FB@小S 徐熙娣）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"小S和老公許雅鈞及女兒合照。（FB@小S 徐熙娣）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260311/1108363263097180160587024.jpeg/wDcbpG4bETCGXcQNiKcXgp_mPStuVzZc8mUsKPJlLCg\"/><figcaption>小S和老公許雅鈞及女兒合照。（FB@小S 徐熙娣）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"小S與大女Elly錄影節目《小姐不熙娣》。（IG@polarbearelly）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260716/1154419318151188480260381.jpeg/GQyi9ARph4Q2xxQesNWg3d9FWSp3MuJ7YjFEMmIxRDI\"/><figcaption>小S與大女Elly錄影節目《小姐不熙娣》。（IG@polarbearelly）</figcaption></figure><p>小S驚現旺角女人街與檔主講價</p><p>日前，有不少網民目擊小S現身旺角街頭，小S一身全黑色打扮，穿上短裙和長靴，狀態依然出色。她現身旺角女人街掃貨，走入攤檔拎起一個手袋，並與檔主講價，獲網民激讚小S連講價都很溫柔。隨後她走入便利店購買飲品，並去金魚檔睇金魚，隨行的還有助理主持派翠克和黃小柔，小S神情悠然自得，狀態相當不錯，身材豐腴不少，女人味十足！</p><p>值得一提的是，這次小S從外景到棚內造型，都穿上女兒們創立的服裝品牌MEUWSE衣着，打扮俐落又不失時尚。</p><figure><img alt=\"小S驚現旺角。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194325763575255040376289.jpeg/QDp8X0coRN7NLQSY-kPaBM82EdbPU0P8sCqv-7Aqr_s\"/><figcaption>小S驚現旺角。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"小S現身街頭錄製節目。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194325778062905344164387.jpeg/_n7r8wiNY99YmNQthoI10eW_vvx4e6RKHod5gB6HeYA\"/><figcaption>小S現身街頭錄製節目。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"小S在女人街掃貨講價。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194325775978205184497068.jpeg/D81yIOtXNVkpxhKSKibhwC3wB5CSBm1kmaVNpJmlTaQ\"/><figcaption>小S在女人街掃貨講價。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"小S睇金魚。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194325773687984128472015.jpeg/Dmh-cvihm3XivImCWREOLMNdhBiV1hueMo3-ZTKN_mU\"/><figcaption>小S睇金魚。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"小S走入便利店買飲品。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194325771506814976837254.jpeg/_ecBmLFUf-pN1vcS_by4C8oAKmvYhnH25unoNubp6DY\"/><figcaption>小S走入便利店買飲品。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"小S身材豐腴。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194325769250148352856143.jpeg/2zg_OwaRvrSlUjfyFB4TP5C2asXmImBR8itdF_IrXRc\"/><figcaption>小S身材豐腴。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T13:22:00.953754+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":503,"images":9,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T13:00:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T13:19:04.907736+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T13:19:04.907736+00:00","content_hash":"8ca6fbc03de6156e4c960c517312b0feb7646023782e5a26fa3b4c7d6a97b78d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}